# ---------- Stormwind, Goldshire, Ironforge ----------
FLY Stormwind | Ariena Stormfeather, south of the bridge
T 120 | From the gryphon master walk through the Trade District to the Valley of Heroes, the bridge inside the main gate. General Marcus Jonathan sits on his horse there.
A 121 | General Marcus Jonathan. Keep it: you are back in Lakeshire in the next segment.
T 118 | Walk out of the gate and down the road to Goldshire (two minutes). Smith Argus works in the smithy.
A 119 | Smith Argus. Keep the Crate of Horseshoes for the next segment.
N Walk back into Stormwind and take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge | The tram station is in the Dwarven District.
TRAIN @ Ironforge, 70.3, 90.7 | Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer in the Hall of Arms (Military Ward, south-east Ironforge): Disarm (18), Mocking Blow and Shield Block (16), and every new rank. You come back here at 20.
FLY Thelsamar | Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master in the middle of Ironforge
S Thelsamar | Innkeeper Hearthstove in the Stoutlager Inn. Buy food here.

# ---------- Loch Modan: the southern troggs ----------
A 436 | Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar (37.2, 47.4)
C 263 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 80.0 | Follow the road south past the Valley of Kings tower and turn east into the Stonesplinter Valley. Kill what is still missing of 10 Stonesplinter Shamans and 10 Bonesnappers (15-16). The Shamans cast: kill them first, and interrupt them with Shield Bash if you carry a shield.
T 263 | Mountaineer Wallbang in the southern guard tower
A 217 | Captain Rugelfuss, in the same tower
A 86585 | Back in the Stonesplinter Valley: the body of Mountaineer Ylva lies at 31.7, 86.4 (new in Forever)
C 86585 | Use the Banner of Ironforge next to the body. The trogg Headsplitter comes for it: kill him. Clear the troggs around the spot first so nothing joins the fight.
C 217 | Grawmug (17) and his guards Gnasher and Brawler (16) stand together in the cave at the very back of the valley (34.8, 90.5). Clear the cave on the way in. Start at full health, kill the two guards first and Grawmug last. Three at once is a hard fight: use your strongest cooldowns or a healing potion, and if it goes badly run out of the cave and try again.
T 217 | Captain Rugelfuss
T 86585 | Captain Rugelfuss

# ---------- The north: Stormpike and the dam ----------
T 353 | Run the road north through Thelsamar to the northern guard tower. Mountaineer Stormpike is in the tower (24.8, 18.4).
A 250 | Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII, in the middle of the Stonewrought Dam at the north end of the loch
T 250 | Walk east along the dam and down the eastern ramp. The Suspicious Barrel stands at 56.1, 13.2 with two Dark Iron Sappers (17) next to it: kill them one after the other.
A 199 | From the Suspicious Barrel
T 199 | Back to Chief Engineer Hinderweir.
A 161 | Chief Engineer Hinderweir: A Dark Threat Looms. The powder goes to Dun Modr in the north of the Wetlands. Do not go now: the route is there at level 30, keep it in your log until then

# ---------- East shore and the Farstrider Lodge ----------
T 2039 | Go back down the eastern ramp and follow the east shore of the loch south. Bingles Blastenheimer stands by his broken flying machine. Stay on the shore: the Mo'grosh ogres in the hills north-east of the loch are elite.
A 2038 | Bingles Blastenheimer. You collect his tools after the lodge.
A 385 | Keep south-east to the Farstrider Lodge. Marek Ironheart is inside.
A 86758 @ Loch Modan, 81.8, 61.6 | Marek Ironheart: Twisting the Knife (new in Forever)
A 257 | Daryl the Youngling, in the lodge. This starts a 15 minute timer.
C 257 | Kill 6 Mountain Buzzards (15-16). They fly over the hills right outside the lodge, south and west of it.
T 257 | Daryl the Youngling
A 258 | Daryl the Youngling. A 12 minute timer: no detours.
C 258 | Kill 5 Elder Mountain Boars (16-17). They roam north-west of the lodge, on the slopes toward Bingles (around 66, 40). Run straight there, kill five and run straight back.
T 258 | Daryl the Youngling
C 385,86758 @ Loch Modan, 61.9, 44.7 | Go back to the east shore. Loch Crocolisks (14-15) lie along the shore and in the shallows from Bingles north: kill them for 5 Crocolisk Meat and 6 Crocolisk Skins. Daggerfang, the crocolisk for Marek's knife, hunts along the same shore (seen between 59 and 66, 34-55). Do not touch the Large Loch Crocolisk (22 elite).
C 2038 @ Loch Modan, 51.0, 25.0 | Swim out to the islands in the north of the loch. Three toolbuckets hold the Wrench (48.7, 30.1), the Screwdriver (48.4, 20.5) and the Hammer (51.8, 24.1); the Blastencapper lies at 54.2, 26.6. Crocolisks swim between the islands.
T 2038 | Back to Bingles Blastenheimer on the east shore
T 385 | Marek Ironheart at the Farstrider Lodge
T 86758 @ Loch Modan, 81.8, 61.6 | Marek Ironheart

# ---------- Ironband's Excavation Site ----------
T 436 | The dig is south-west of the lodge. Magmar Fellhew stands in the camp above it.
A 297 | Magmar Fellhew
A 298 | Prospector Ironband, next to him. Just a letter for Thelsamar.
A 86613 @ Loch Modan, 70.2, 64.5 | Excavation Tools (new in Forever). The quest starts from the Excavation Tools you pick up inside the dig; the data has no exact spots. Look for tool sets on the ground while you kill troggs, and pick up six. If you find none, press Skip here and on its hand-in.
C 297,86613 @ Loch Modan, 70.2, 64.5 | Go down into the dig. Stonesplinter Geomancers (17-18), Diggers (18-19) and Berserk Troggs (19-20) drop the 8 Carved Stone Idols. Pull from the edge, one trogg at a time, and kill Geomancers first: they cast fire spells, so interrupt them with Shield Bash if you carry a shield. Collect the six tool sets while you are down there.
T 297 | Magmar Fellhew
T 86613 @ Loch Modan, 65.9, 65.6 | Prospector Ironband

# ---------- West shore and Thelsamar ----------
L 20 @ Loch Modan, 70.2, 64.5 | Only if you are not close to 20 yet (the step ticks by itself at 20). The Ironforge trip that comes next is your level 20 training stop, and the warrior's level 20 quest starts there. The two hand-ins on the way back to Thelsamar give about 3,000 XP with the kills on the way: if your level 19 bar reads less than about 18,200 / 21,300, kill troggs in the dig (17-20) until it does, then press Skip. Expect to need 25 to 30 kills.
A 86614 | Walk west along the south end of the loch and up its west shore. The Discarded Fishing Toolbox lies on the shore at 48.8, 54.0 (new in Forever).
T 86614 | Khara Deepwater, the fishing trainer on the shore north-east of Thelsamar (40.4, 39.4)
T 298 | Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar
A 301 | Jern Hornhelm

# ---------- Ironforge: training at 20 ----------
FLY Ironforge | Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar. You should be level 20 now.
T 301 | Prospector Stormpike in the Hall of Explorers
A 302 @ Ironforge, 74.6, 11.7 | Prospector Stormpike
TRAIN @ Ironforge, 70.3, 90.7 | Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer in the Hall of Arms (Military Ward, south-east Ironforge): Victory Rush (new in Forever: usable after a kill that gives experience, it heals you, so press it after every kill), Cleave, Slam and Retaliation (all level 20).
A 1698 @ Ironforge, 70.3, 90.7 | Kelv Sternhammer: Yorus Barleybrew, the warrior's level 20 quest. Yorus is in Lakeshire, where the next segment goes
A 2041 | Gnoarn the gnome (ForeverChanges shows him at 62.2, 29.2; Questie has him in Tinker Town at 69.2, 50.6). A letter for Stormwind, handed in in the next segment.

# ---------- Loch Modan: the shipment ----------
FLY Thelsamar | Gryth Thurden
T 302 | Jern Hornhelm
A 273 | Jern Hornhelm
A 468 | Mountaineer Kadrell walks the road through Thelsamar (needs level 19)
T 273 | Huldar waits on the road south of the loch (52.2, 69.3), on the way to the dig
A 454 | Huldar
T 454 | Miran, next to him
A 309 | Miran. This starts an escort to the excavation site.
C 309 @ Loch Modan, 52.2, 69.4 | Walk with Miran. Dark Iron dwarves ambush the cart on the way: stay close to Miran, keep the attackers on you and kill them one at a time; you cannot heal him. Miran must survive.
T 309 | Prospector Ironband at the excavation camp

# ---------- Dun Algaz ----------
T 468 | Walk back around the south end of the loch, through Thelsamar and up the road north. Mountaineer Rockgar guards the Dun Algaz tunnel in the north-west corner of Loch Modan (25.4, 10.4)
A 455 | Mountaineer Rockgar
C 455 | Go into the Dun Algaz tunnels behind Rockgar. Dragonmaw Scouts (19-20) and Grunts (20-21) stand along the road and in the side camps: kill 8 Scouts and 6 Grunts. They hit hard for your level: one at a time, at full health, eat or bandage between pulls, and finish runners fast or slow them if you can. You do not have to walk through to the Wetlands now. Whatever is missing you can finish in segment 8: press Skip then.
H Thelsamar | Hearthstone back to the inn
